234	  // atomic claim inside the charge tx succeeds — otherwise (already redeemed by
235	  // this account/IP, or the promo is off) the server is created at FULL price. The
236	  // eligibility pre-check only picks the balance gate so a first-time customer with
237	  // just enough for the discounted price isn't wrongly turned away.
238	  // First-month-free is scoped to Shared Web Hosting only — game plans always
